        "jsCode": "// Record L'Oreal's actual stated thesis so future match runs respect it.\n// Kept as ONE row (the user wants them retained in INVESTORS), with both verticals in sector.\nreturn [{ json: {\n  investor: \"L'Oreal Venture Capital\",\n  contact_person: 'Filippo',\n  email: 'filippo.principi@loreal.com',\n  sector: 'V1 Beauty & Wellness Brands (never leads; co-lead/follow; needs $1-10M traction). V2 Science & Tech for Beauty (tech/biotech, needs scientific validation + L Oreal strategic interest; never pre-seed/seed)',\n  stage: 'V1 growth-stage brands; V2 post-seed only',\n  cheque_inr_cr: 'V1 US$1-3M; V2 US$4-10M'\n}}];"
